### Available Lab Test Order Routes:
### GET /api/v1/lab-test-orders/:orderId - Get specific lab test order by ID
### GET /api/v1/lab-tests/orders - Get all lab test orders with filtering
### POST /api/v1/lab-tests/orders - Create new lab test order
### PUT /api/v1/lab-test-orders/:orderId/status - Update lab test order status